scroll-behavior: smooth; color: #334155; }\n    .hero-gradient { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #004aad 0%, #002d6b 100%); }\n    .glass-effect { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }\n    .product-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); transition: all 0.3s ease; box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1); }\n</style></p>\n\n<!-- BREADCRUMB -->\n<nav class=\"bg-gray-100 py-3 px-4 border-b\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-xs md:text-sm flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-500\">\n        <a href=\"/\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Home</a> <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right text-[10px]\"></i>\n        <a href=\"/ac-services\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">AC Services</a> <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right text-[10px]\"></i>\n        <span class=\"text-gray-900 font-semibold text-blue-500\">AC Installation Valsad</span>\n    </div>\n</nav>\n\n<!-- HERO SECTION -->\n<header class=\"hero-gradient text-white py-24 px-4 relative overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 opacity-10 -mr-20 -mt-20\">\n        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"400\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\"><path d=\"M12,2L4.5,20.29L5.21,21L12,18L18.79,21L19.5,20.29L12,2Z\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10 text-white\">\n        <span class=\"bg-blue-500/30 text-blue-100 px-6 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 inline-block italic\">Valsad District&#8217;s Premier HVAC Engineering Specialist</span>\n        <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-7xl font-black mb-6 leading-tight text-white\">Professional and Standard AC Installation in Valsad</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-blue-100 mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed text-white\">Advanced 7-step AC commissioning for the Mango City. Precision mounting and 500-micron vacuuming for Tithal Road residences and Vapi industrial hubs.</p>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4\">\n            <a class=\"bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg shadow-xl transition-all flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> \n                <i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp text-2xl text-white\"></i> <span class=\"text-white\">Chat for Quote</span>\n            </a> \n            <a class=\"bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white border border-white/30 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg transition-all\" href=\"#technical\">Technical Workflow</a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- THE ATLAS DIFFERENCE -->\n<section id=\"technical\" class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-white\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center\">\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-10 h-10 text-blue-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\"></path></svg>\n                    Technical AC Setup for Valsad&#8217;s Coastal Environment\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">In Valsad, the combination of high rainfall, proximity to Tithal beach, and chemical industrial air in Vapi requires expert HVAC handling. A standard installation skipping the vacuuming process leads to coil damage. Most industrial managers trust professional <a href=\"/ac-repair-valsad\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold underline\">AC Repair in Valsad</a> specialists for new commissioning. At Atlas Aircon, we follow a <strong>7-Step Precision Protocol</strong> to shield your system from the district&#8217;s humid and corrosive atmospheric conditions.</p>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\n                        <div><strong>Nitrogen Leak Testing:</strong> Every joint is tested at high pressure to ensure a permanent, leak-proof <a href=\"/gas-charging-service/\" class=\"text-blue-700 font-medium hover:underline\">Gas Charging Service</a>.</div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\n                        <div><strong>Deep Micron Vacuuming:</strong> We use industrial pumps to achieve 500 microns, crucial for preventing compressor sludge in Valsad&#8217;s moisture-heavy river belts.</div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\"></path></svg>\n                        <div><strong>Safety-Matched Wiring:</strong> Utilizing high-grade <a href=\"/copper-wire/\" class=\"text-blue-700 font-medium hover:underline\">copper wiring</a> to prevent electrical trips during peak industrial surge loads.</div>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"relative group\">\n                <!-- SVG Illustration -->\n                <svg vie