TION CHECKLIST -->\n<section class=\"py-20 px-4\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n        <div class=\"bg-blue-900 rounded-[3rem] p-10 md:p-16 text-white flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 items-center shadow-2xl\">\n            <div class=\"lg:w-1/2\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">Homeowner&#8217;s Pre-Installation Checklist</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-blue-200 mb-8\">Ensure a smooth service for your <a href=\"/split-ac-service-valsad\" class=\"text-blue-300 font-bold hover:underline\">Split AC Setup</a> in Valsad:</p>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-400 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg> 16A Dedicated Socket ready?</div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-400 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg> Outdoor unit ledge clear?</div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-400 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg> Society permission obtained?</div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-400 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg> Drain pipe route ready?</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lg:w-1/2 glass-effect p-8 rounded-3xl text-gray-900 shadow-lg\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Valsad Installation Spares</h3>\n                <p class=\"mb-6 text-gray-600 text-sm\">Industrial-grade components for <a href=\"/ducting-repair-services-valsad\" class=\"text-blue-700 font-medium\">ducting repairs</a> and new split setups.</p>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-6 text-sm\">\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\"><span>Professional Mounting</span> <strong>Fixed Rate</strong></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\"><span>Extra <a href=\"/copper-pipe/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">Copper Pipe</a></span> <strong>Standard Cost</strong></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\"><span>Heavy Duty <a href=\"/outdoor-stand/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">MS Stand</a></span> <strong>Standard Rate</strong></li>\n                </ul>\n                <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"block w-full text-center bg-blue-600 text-white py-3 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-lg transform transition hover:-translate-y-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get Instant Valsad Quote</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- LOCAL REACH - VALSAD SERVICE AREAS -->\n<section class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-100\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center text-white\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-16 italic text-gray-900\">Serving the District of Valsad &#038; Vapi</h2>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 text-left text-white\">\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-blue-800 border-b pb-4\">Residential Areas</h3>\n                <div class=\"h-64 overflow-y-auto text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 pr-4 space-y-2\">\n                    Tithal Road, Dharampur Road, Abrama, Mograwadi, Halar, Bhagda Wade, Pali Hill, Valsad INA, Lilapore, Gundlav, Parnera, Atul, Pardi Town, Valsad Sugar Factory Area, Kasturba Hospital Road, Stadium Road, Avabai School Area.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-blue-800 border-b pb-4 text-white\">Industrial GIDC Hubs</h3>\n                <div class=\"h-64 overflow-y-auto text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 pr-4 space-y-2\">\n                    Vapi GIDC, Pardi Industrial Estate, Sarigam GIDC, Umbergaon GIDC, Gundlav GIDC, Atul Industrial Cluster, Bhilad Industrial Area, Valsad INA Industrial Belt.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FAQ SECTION - 10 QUESTIONS -->\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 italic text-gray-900 text-center\">10 Critical AC Installation FAQs for Valsad</h2>\n        <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n            <!-- FAQ 1 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\" open>\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    Why is vacuuming critical for new ACs near Tithal Beach?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Valsad&#8217;s coastal air is highly humid. Moisture trapped during installation reacts with refrigerant to form sludge, leading to compressor burnout. Our <a href=\"/ac-service-valsad\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">Valsad AC service</a> uses industrial vacuum pumps for every setup.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 2 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    How long does a standard professional setup take?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">A professional technical installation in Valsad typically takes 2.5 to 3 hours, ensuring nitrogen testing and vacuuming are completed.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 3 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    Do you provide VRF installation for Vapi GIDC factories?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Yes, we specialize in high-capacity <a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-valsad\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">Central AC installations</a> for industrial plants and pharma offices in Vapi GIDC.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 4 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    What is the ideal mounting height for the indoor unit?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Ideally, 7.5 to 8 feet from the floor for best air rotation and ease of future <a href=\"/ac-repair-valsad\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold underline\">repair</a> access.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 5 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    Do you offer a workmanship warranty in Pardi?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Yes, Atlas Aircon provides a 30-day installation guarantee for every job in Valsad and Pardi. If any leak occurs, we fix it free.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 6 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    Can I reuse copper pipes for a new Inverter unit?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">We strongly recommend new <a href=\"/copper-pipe/\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\">copper piping</a> because old pipes may contain residual oil or micro-leaks that damage R32 gas systems.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 7 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    Is a heavy-duty MS stand necessary for outdoor units?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Yes. A heavy-duty <a href=\"/outdoor-stand/\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\">outdoor stand</a> ensures safety against South Gujarat&#8217;s high winds and reduces unit vibration noise.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 8 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    Do you repair commercial deep freezers in Valsad?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Yes, our mobile teams handle commercial <a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-valsad\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline text-blue-500\">deep freezer repair</a> and industrial maintenance.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 9 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    What electrical wiring is required?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">A dedicated 20A socket and 4.0 sq mm <a href=\"/copper-wire/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">multi-strand wire</a> are essential to prevent heating during power load.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 10 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    How often should I service my AC in Valsad&#8217;s humidity?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Due to coastal moisture and dust, we recommend a professional <a href=\"/ac-service-valsad\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline font-semibold text-blue-500\">service</a> every 4 months for better efficiency.</p>\n            </details>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FINAL CTA -->\n<section class=\"py-24 px-4 hero-gradient text-white text-center\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-white\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-6 text-white\">Ready for 10/10 Cooling in Valsad?</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-lg mb-10 text-white\">Experience the difference of technical precision. Trust Valsad district&#8217;s HVAC engineering experts for your home or business.</p>\n        <a class=\"inline-block bg-white text-blue-900 px-12 py-5 rounded-2xl font-black text-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transform hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-2xl\" href=\"tel:+919727257141\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt mr-2\"></i> Book Valsad Installation Now\n        </a>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n",
